      "title": "Gran Fil Super Electronic",
      "h1": "Marini Gran Fil Super Electronic",
      "description": "Gran Fil Super Electronic is a diamond wire saw from Marini's granite line with variable wire speed (0 - 40 m/s) controlled by an inverter. Main motor 45 / 55 kW, weight 1,860 / 1,900 kg.",
      "blocks": [
