        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Gran Fil Super Electronic is a diamond wire saw from Marini's granite line with variable wire speed (0 - 40 m/s) controlled by an inverter. Main motor 45 / 55 kW, weight 1,860 / 1,900 kg.",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "The machine positions quickly on its rails and keeps the diamond wire evenly and accurately tensioned during the cut. The flywheel group can rotate 360° and move on electric motors (depending on version), so the saw is aligned quickly and parallel cuts can be made without moving the rails. It can cut on inclined surfaces in any direction and flush with the quarry floor. The light control panel can be placed at a safe distance from the saw.",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Main motor: 45 / 55 kW",
            "Weight: 1,860 / 1,900 kg",
            "Wire speed: 0 - 40 m/s"
